Database migrations (Alembic). Run every command from the backend/ folder.

  alembic upgrade head                                    apply all migrations
  alembic downgrade -1                                    undo the last migration
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add x to y"         write a migration from model changes
  alembic history                                         list migrations
  alembic current                                         show the database's version

Always read an autogenerated migration before applying it.
